(5533021, 798437, 30049, '<td valign="top">While this is on the fringe of DNMC, I think it would have "sold" better if the hand was that of a young child.  I like the dynamic of the angle and the overall comp of this.  It''s a technically well done photo.  Just a bit too much of a shoehorn IMO.  Good luck.</td>', 'While this is on the fringe of DNMC, I think it would have "sold" better if the hand was that of a young child.  I like the dynamic of the angle and the overall comp of this.  It''s a technically well done photo.  Just a bit too much of a shoehorn IMO.  Good luck.', '2009-06-17 10:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
