(5533030, 799736, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice work in B/W.  Some great choices made by the photographer here in the comp.  The rails at the bottom and top make for natural stop zones, keeping the viewer inside the boundaries.  The diagonal beams add some tension.  Doesn''t hurt that the workers are on the diagonal also.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice work in B/W.  Some great choices made by the photographer here in the comp.  The rails at the bottom and top make for natural stop zones, keeping the viewer inside the boundaries.  The diagonal beams add some tension.  Doesn''t hurt that the workers are on the diagonal also.  Well done!', '2009-06-17 10:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
