(5533369, 799938, 103032, '<td valign="top">Ya that''s what I''m talking about.  This is what I imagine this challenge to be, ironworkers walking the steel.  This is a construction shot.  This is what I wanted to take...    Oh ya, composition is good, technical aspect is good, POV is awesome.  10, I''m thinking a blue ribbon.</td>', 'Ya that''s what I''m talking about.  This is what I imagine this challenge to be, ironworkers walking the steel.  This is a construction shot.  This is what I wanted to take...    Oh ya, composition is good, technical aspect is good, POV is awesome.  10, I''m thinking a blue ribbon.', '2009-06-17 14:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533373, 800040, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great night shot.  Great details of the job site.  I''m guessing a relatively quick shutter speed (1/15 to 1/60?) since the workman seems to be walking but not really blurred.  Did the flood lights provide enough light for moderately low ISO setting?  No noise to speak of (that I can tell).  I like the shot for the subject and for the technical aspect.  I''m curious to know the details on the settings for this shot...  Well done. Should be a ribbon.</td>', 'Great night shot.  Great details of the job site.  I''m guessing a relatively quick shutter speed (1/15 to 1/60?) since the workman seems to be walking but not really blurred.  Did the flood lights provide enough light for moderately low ISO setting?  No noise to speak of (that I can tell).  I like the shot for the subject and for the technical aspect.  I''m curious to know the details on the settings for this shot...  Well done. Should be a ribbon.', '2009-06-17 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5533375, 799546, 103032, '<td valign="top">I love construction techniques in Asia (I''m guessing Asia having seen the use of bamboo for scaffolding over there).  I''m actually impressed with bamboo scaffolding.  Nice colors, nice shot.</td>', 'I love construction techniques in Asia (I''m guessing Asia having seen the use of bamboo for scaffolding over there).  I''m actually impressed with bamboo scaffolding.  Nice colors, nice shot.', '2009-06-17 14:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
