(5535953, 799854, 62187, '<td valign="top">Not the biggest construction site for the challenge but a very, very nice find.</td>', 'Not the biggest construction site for the challenge but a very, very nice find.', '2009-06-19 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536229, 799657, 67363, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent..such detail! Meets the challenge well</td>', 'This is magnificent..such detail! Meets the challenge well', '2009-06-19 09:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536489, 799902, 40355, '<td valign="top">The cement support has brighter tones than the workers, and thus draws the eye directly to it.  Since it''s not the main subject, nor very interesting, this takes away from the essence of the image.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have been better.</td>', 'The cement support has brighter tones than the workers, and thus draws the eye directly to it.  Since it''s not the main subject, nor very interesting, this takes away from the essence of the image.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have been better.', '2009-06-19 13:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536490, 799934, 40355, '<td valign="top">Overexposure on the building and water hurts this one.</td>', 'Overexposure on the building and water hurts this one.', '2009-06-19 13:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536491, 799684, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but the angle could be better if it were more to the right - especially if it didn''t clip the edge of the bucket off.</td>', 'Interesting image, but the angle could be better if it were more to the right - especially if it didn''t clip the edge of the bucket off.', '2009-06-19 13:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536493, 799893, 40355, '<td valign="top">Too underexposed.  Shooting into the sun is hard to do successfully.  If it were just the cranes, this might work - but all the foreground blocks up too much.</td>', 'Too underexposed.  Shooting into the sun is hard to do successfully.  If it were just the cranes, this might work - but all the foreground blocks up too much.', '2009-06-19 13:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536494, 799736, 40355, '<td valign="top">Strong use of lines in the image, both the beams and the rails at the top &amp; bottom.  Maybe a touch more contrast, but otherwise quite nice.</td>', 'Strong use of lines in the image, both the beams and the rails at the top & bottom.  Maybe a touch more contrast, but otherwise quite nice.', '2009-06-19 13:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536496, 799761, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very cool - the cloud texture keeps the sky from being so much empty space.  I''d be curious how it''d look if you had gone vertical, and only showed the three towers, and not the stuff to the right - if this would have tightened it up even more.</td>', 'Very cool - the cloud texture keeps the sky from being so much empty space.  I''d be curious how it''d look if you had gone vertical, and only showed the three towers, and not the stuff to the right - if this would have tightened it up even more.', '2009-06-19 13:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536498, 800040, 40355, '<td valign="top">The overexposure at the bottom hurts this shot, which otherwise has some interesting merit.</td>', 'The overexposure at the bottom hurts this shot, which otherwise has some interesting merit.', '2009-06-19 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536500, 799590, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good use of angles, nice tonal range.  Overall a 7.</td>', 'Good use of angles, nice tonal range.  Overall a 7.', '2009-06-19 13:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536502, 799938, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wish the angle was from the front, so we could see his face.  But even as is, it''s a strong image - excellent sense of energy in it, a feeling of real construction.  Well done.</td>', 'Wish the angle was from the front, so we could see his face.  But even as is, it''s a strong image - excellent sense of energy in it, a feeling of real construction.  Well done.', '2009-06-19 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536504, 799991, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on a common subject.  Points for creativity.  Not a captivating photo, but that merits a second look.</td>', 'Interesting take on a common subject.  Points for creativity.  Not a captivating photo, but that merits a second look.', '2009-06-19 13:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536505, 799323, 40355, '<td valign="top">Would have been a stronger image if you hadn''t cut off the bucket &amp; the bottom of the tire.  Also some haloing around the cab.</td>', 'Would have been a stronger image if you hadn''t cut off the bucket & the bottom of the tire.  Also some haloing around the cab.', '2009-06-19 13:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536507, 799734, 40355, '<td valign="top">Too much dead space at the bottom; frame the car near the bottom and show the rest of the building. instead of cutting it off.  Otherwise, and interesting image to ponder, with lovely tones.</td>', 'Too much dead space at the bottom; frame the car near the bottom and show the rest of the building. instead of cutting it off.  Otherwise, and interesting image to ponder, with lovely tones.', '2009-06-19 13:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536510, 800043, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail moment here - the smaller elements of construction that few people bother to notice.  Good eye!</td>', 'Very nice detail moment here - the smaller elements of construction that few people bother to notice.  Good eye!', '2009-06-19 13:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536511, 799972, 40355, '<td valign="top">The best image I''ve yet seen in this challenge.  Lovely silhouettes, interesting skyline, interesting sky.  Well done! 9</td>', 'The best image I''ve yet seen in this challenge.  Lovely silhouettes, interesting skyline, interesting sky.  Well done! 9', '2009-06-19 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536512, 799259, 40355, '<td valign="top">Cute and imaginative take on the challenge, but suffers from technical problems, mainly overexposure of the foreground &amp; bun, and the yellow color cast.  A custom white balance would have improved this, as well as a better-balanced exposure.  And throw down another paper bag in the BG to hide the wood floor.</td>', 'Cute and imaginative take on the challenge, but suffers from technical problems, mainly overexposure of the foreground & bun, and the yellow color cast.  A custom white balance would have improved this, as well as a better-balanced exposure.  And throw down another paper bag in the BG to hide the wood floor.', '2009-06-19 13:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536515, 798708, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but both the cranes are cut off at the tips.  Might have worked better as a vertical?</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but both the cranes are cut off at the tips.  Might have worked better as a vertical?', '2009-06-19 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536519, 799512, 40355, '<td valign="top">Way overprocessed.  That doesn''t even look like the sky on this planet.  Also, too much dead space above the crane - show more of the city and fill in that space.  Some perspective correction would really have helped as well, as the crane feels like it''s about to fall over.</td>', 'Way overprocessed.  That doesn''t even look like the sky on this planet.  Also, too much dead space above the crane - show more of the city and fill in that space.  Some perspective correction would really have helped as well, as the crane feels like it''s about to fall over.', '2009-06-19 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5536590, 799176, 66635, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''d call it construction, but I like it very much nonetheless.</td>', 'I''m not sure I''d call it construction, but I like it very much nonetheless.', '2009-06-19 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
