(5537918, 800034, 38162, '<td valign="top">did you consider cloning out all shadow?  super concept.</td>', 'did you consider cloning out all shadow?  super concept.', '2009-06-20 21:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537920, 799512, 38162, '<td valign="top">not an hdr candidate imo - just too overprocessed.  terrific concept for initial capture.</td>', 'not an hdr candidate imo - just too overprocessed.  terrific concept for initial capture.', '2009-06-20 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5537922, 799176, 38162, '<td valign="top">tough call on this one as to shoehorn into this challenge.  well done though.</td>', 'tough call on this one as to shoehorn into this challenge.  well done though.', '2009-06-20 21:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538215, 798829, 66494, '<td valign="top">Nice POV on this one, and the coloring is warm and welcoming. Gotta love that sky.</td>', 'Nice POV on this one, and the coloring is warm and welcoming. Gotta love that sky.', '2009-06-21 06:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538216, 798805, 66494, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a lot of scaffolding. I think the BW works well here.</td>', 'Wow, that is a lot of scaffolding. I think the BW works well here.', '2009-06-21 06:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538218, 798773, 66494, '<td valign="top">What a killer view, nice find.</td>', 'What a killer view, nice find.', '2009-06-21 06:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538220, 799323, 66494, '<td valign="top">Nice POV you chose.</td>', 'Nice POV you chose.', '2009-06-21 06:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538222, 799939, 66494, '<td valign="top">The lack of color really helps pull this shot together and give it more presence.</td>', 'The lack of color really helps pull this shot together and give it more presence.', '2009-06-21 06:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538223, 799808, 66494, '<td valign="top">Nice find. I think choosing to do this shot at night really works better than a daytime view.</td>', 'Nice find. I think choosing to do this shot at night really works better than a daytime view.', '2009-06-21 06:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538286, 799259, 107607, '<td valign="top">Great and fun concept, can''t go past a 10.</td>', 'Great and fun concept, can''t go past a 10.', '2009-06-21 09:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538290, 799728, 88580, '<td valign="top">Great out-of-the-box thinking that even fits the challenge perfectly.  You''ve captured an amazing amount of detail, the bee''s pose is excellent, and his colors are exactly what you''d expect to see on a construction site.</td>', 'Great out-of-the-box thinking that even fits the challenge perfectly.  You''ve captured an amazing amount of detail, the bee''s pose is excellent, and his colors are exactly what you''d expect to see on a construction site.', '2009-06-21 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538300, 799734, 88580, '<td valign="top">I guess the building in the background is under construction?  I think I see a guy in a hardhat in the lower left, and there''s a guy on the second floor, but my thought is that they are preparing to implode this building rather than working on finishing it it.  That may or may not be the case, but that''s how it seems to me.  If fact, the building doesn''t even command much attention even though it fills most of the frame.  The car is what draws the eye (and the title steers the eye in that direction, too).  The whole image just feels run down looking, and the B/W conversion suits it well.  It''s an image to be proud of, but I bet it will get hammered with DNMCs.</td>', 'I guess the building in the background is under construction?  I think I see a guy in a hardhat in the lower left, and there''s a guy on the second floor, but my thought is that they are preparing to implode this building rather than working on finishing it it.  That may or may not be the case, but that''s how it seems to me.  If fact, the building doesn''t even command much attention even though it fills most of the frame.  The car is what draws the eye (and the title steers the eye in that direction, too).  The whole image just feels run down looking, and the B/W conversion suits it well.  It''s an image to be proud of, but I bet it will get hammered with DNMCs.', '2009-06-21 09:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538303, 799761, 88580, '<td valign="top">No one should be able to DNMC this one; there''s an amazing amount of construction going on!  I''d say you picked the perfect time of the evening to capture this one.  The cool colors are nice, especially with the warm lights and starbursts for contrast.</td>', 'No one should be able to DNMC this one; there''s an amazing amount of construction going on!  I''d say you picked the perfect time of the evening to capture this one.  The cool colors are nice, especially with the warm lights and starbursts for contrast.', '2009-06-21 10:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538305, 799806, 88580, '<td valign="top">I really like the dappled lighting and how it adds little splashes of color to what would have otherwise been a perfect silhouette.  The color looks great against the deep blue sky.</td>', 'I really like the dappled lighting and how it adds little splashes of color to what would have otherwise been a perfect silhouette.  The color looks great against the deep blue sky.', '2009-06-21 10:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538306, 799984, 88580, '<td valign="top">Good title because from this vantage point it even looks like a Tonka toy.</td>', 'Good title because from this vantage point it even looks like a Tonka toy.', '2009-06-21 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538308, 799994, 88580, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it is Escher-ish.  Relativity, I guess?  The guy--with his head down and the hardhat hiding his face--has that same anonymous look that a lot Escher''s people did.</td>', 'Yeah, it is Escher-ish.  Relativity, I guess?  The guy--with his head down and the hardhat hiding his face--has that same anonymous look that a lot Escher''s people did.', '2009-06-21 10:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538310, 799934, 88580, '<td valign="top">Now that''s funny.  A well-timed, lucky capture for sure.  Perfect for this challenge.  :)</td>', 'Now that''s funny.  A well-timed, lucky capture for sure.  Perfect for this challenge.  :)', '2009-06-21 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538312, 799546, 88580, '<td valign="top">I''m really curious about that "scaffolding."  It looks like a bunch of bamboo lashed together.  It''s interesting how the netting coordinates with the buildings primary-color color scheme.</td>', 'I''m really curious about that "scaffolding."  It looks like a bunch of bamboo lashed together.  It''s interesting how the netting coordinates with the buildings primary-color color scheme.', '2009-06-21 10:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538313, 799972, 88580, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a lot of shots like this one.  The colors, clouds, and silhouettes are nice.  I like the way the cranes frame the other parts of the image.</td>', 'I expected to see a lot of shots like this one.  The colors, clouds, and silhouettes are nice.  I like the way the cranes frame the other parts of the image.', '2009-06-21 10:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538314, 799949, 88580, '<td valign="top">I really like the crop on this.  There''s just enough of the crane and the building to convey the idea.  I would have tried to fit everything into the frame, and it probably would not have had the same impact.  It could be a touch brighter, I think.</td>', 'I really like the crop on this.  There''s just enough of the crane and the building to convey the idea.  I would have tried to fit everything into the frame, and it probably would not have had the same impact.  It could be a touch brighter, I think.', '2009-06-21 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538316, 800022, 88580, '<td valign="top">A shoehorn for sure.</td>', 'A shoehorn for sure.', '2009-06-21 10:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538355, 799574, 101678, '<td valign="top">Hey!!  I can almost see my condo off to the left!!  Nice shot of the Mirabella</td>', 'Hey!!  I can almost see my condo off to the left!!  Nice shot of the Mirabella', '2009-06-21 13:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538466, 799938, 1031, '<td valign="top">Not an angle I''d be paricularly likely to shoot from myself -- very nice.</td>', 'Not an angle I''d be paricularly likely to shoot from myself -- very nice.', '2009-06-21 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5538555, 799176, 92296, '<td valign="top">I think this might be entered in the wrong compe....oooh...boobies! 6</td>', 'I think this might be entered in the wrong compe....oooh...boobies! 6', '2009-06-21 19:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539214, 798805, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice dynamic feel to this one.</td>', 'Nice dynamic feel to this one.', '2009-06-22 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539215, 799513, 33736, '<td valign="top">Charming view point</td>', 'Charming view point', '2009-06-22 07:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539216, 799657, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice find!</td>', 'Nice find!', '2009-06-22 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539217, 799259, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wish the whole picture was sharp throughout (short DOF is a bit distracting in this case), but high marks for a darned clever creation!</td>', 'Wish the whole picture was sharp throughout (short DOF is a bit distracting in this case), but high marks for a darned clever creation!', '2009-06-22 07:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539219, 799995, 33736, '<td valign="top">This should have been a terrific image, but the choice of harsh coloring (which emphasizes the background ''noise''), the tilt of the elements, and the overall darkness just aren''t working in the long run for me.</td>', 'This should have been a terrific image, but the choice of harsh coloring (which emphasizes the background ''noise''), the tilt of the elements, and the overall darkness just aren''t working in the long run for me.', '2009-06-22 07:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539223, 799085, 33736, '<td valign="top">This will probably score highly, because it''s a terrific image, but it does not say anything about ''construction'' to me.</td>', 'This will probably score highly, because it''s a terrific image, but it does not say anything about ''construction'' to me.', '2009-06-22 07:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539227, 798829, 33736, '<td valign="top">This looks as though it''s ''filtered'', but it''s a terrific shot.</td>', 'This looks as though it''s ''filtered'', but it''s a terrific shot.', '2009-06-22 07:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
