(5539751, 799469, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone was going to try this take on it. I just can''t interpret the topic widely enough to include this, I''m afraid. Good try, however, and a cute kid.</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone was going to try this take on it. I just can''t interpret the topic widely enough to include this, I''m afraid. Good try, however, and a cute kid.', '2009-06-22 14:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
