(5541930, 799259, 20608, '<td valign="top">Interesting....<br/> <br/>New photo up for a vote, vote early and often... //bit.ly/4abiE (need to copy and paste it cos link dont work) 5:46 AM Jun 17th from web taken from <a href="//twitter.com/micah_beree" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> so I find <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=107607" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mj202</a> comment rather interesting too.<br/> <br/>care to explain why you would link directly to the voting page of this image from you twitter site asking to vote?<br/> <br/>I think the image is good and would of stood up quite well on it''s own merits without your ''AD''<br/> <br/>Sorry to be the one to burst your top 10 bubble</td>', 'Interesting.... New photo up for a vote, vote early and often... //bit.ly/4abiE (need to copy and paste it cos link dont work) 5:46 AM Jun 17th from web taken from here so I find  mj202 comment rather interesting too. care to explain why you would link directly to the voting page of this image from you twitter site asking to vote? I think the image is good and would of stood up quite well on it''s own merits without your ''AD'' Sorry to be the one to burst your top 10 bubble', '2009-06-24 07:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5541937, 799972, 55005, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red, Erik!  You''ve completed your set!! Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on the red, Erik!  You''ve completed your set!! Well done!', '2009-06-24 07:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5541946, 799306, 103032, '<td valign="top">I thought this would place higher.  It was in the top three in my book.  It has construction written all over it.  I think its a great shot for the challenge.</td>', 'I thought this would place higher.  It was in the top three in my book.  It has construction written all over it.  I think its a great shot for the challenge.', '2009-06-24 07:47:40.000000', NULL, 0),
